Caption: Stability of the operator and the twins across 5 independent fits of dinov2_vitb14_reg (disjoint ImageNet-train fit sets and a COCO fit). (a) Eigenvalues of the span matrix S, whose signs give the stream operator, sorted by magnitude: positive eigenvalues are even directions, negative ones odd directions ($d_-$: fit set 0 68, fit set 1 69, fit set 2 68, fit set 3 68, COCO 73). (b) Energy-weighted agreement of the odd subspaces and (c) share of the strong twin pairs in blocks 1 to 6 that the other fit also pairs, each the mean of both directions. Outlined cells fall below the pre-registered bar (0.8 and 0.7; the rules cover pairs of ImageNet fits only). Rule A02-2: PASS; rule A02-3: PASS.

